       "html": "<!-- LEDAJANS SEO - Sayfa Üstü Hero/Banner - P4 İç Mekan RGB Panel -->\n<style>\n.ledajans-blog-hero { position: relative; height: 200px; background-image: url('https://ledajans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Firefly_Gemini-Flash_LEDAJANS-yazisi-tamamen-turuncu-olsun-o-kadar-13541.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; }\n@media (min-width: 640px) { .ledajans-blog-hero { height: 250px; } }\n@media (min-width: 768px) { .ledajans-blog-hero { height: 300px; } }\n.ledajans-blog-hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.85), rgba(22, 33, 62, 0.8)); }\n.ledajans-blog-hero-inner { position: relative; height: 100%; max-width: 80rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; }\n@media (min-width: 640px) { .ledajans-blog-hero-inner { padding: 0 1.5rem; } }\n@media (min-width: 1024px) { .ledajans-blog-hero-inner { padding: 0 2rem; } }\n.ledajans-blog-hero-content { font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; }\n.ledajans-blog-hero-title { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.2; }\n@media (min-width: 640px) { .ledajans-blog-hero-title { font-size: 2.5rem; } }\n@media (min-width: 768px) { .ledajans-blog-hero-title { font-size: 3rem; } }\n.ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle { display: block; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 400; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5; }\n@media (min-width: 640px) { .ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle { font-size: 1rem; } }\n@media (min-width: 768px) { .ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle { font-size: 1.125rem; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"ledajans-blog-hero\">\n<div class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-inner\">\n<div class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-content\">\n<h1 class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-title\">P4 İç Mekan RGB Panel</h1>\n<span class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle\" style=\"color:#f46f2c\">4mm piksel aralığı, 62.500 piksel/m² – SMD2121 3’ü 1 arada, ≥600 cd/m² parlaklık, 15bit gri; geniş alan ve uzak mesafe iç mekan LED ekran projeleri için uygun maliyetli çözüm.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
